  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig 30, 'Visualization of future-state architecture from Malawi's SCSA'. Layers from top: analytics and business intelligence (data warehouse, dashboards, reports, traceability, returns and recalls, verification); an OpenHIM interoperability layer; national supply chain information systems (procurement, forecasting and planning, supplier and contract, warehouse and transportation management) beside facility systems (OpenLMIS, cStock, eHIN); a second interoperability layer; and regulatory and foundational components (product item registration, product registry, facility registry, supplier registry, terminology). A global GFPVAN and manufacturers link from the left. Adapted from Malawi's 2022 Supply Chain Systems Architecture.",
